  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a clay or ceramic tagine over medium heat.",
    "Add chicken and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add onion and garlic and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add spices, preserved lemon, carrots, and potatoes.",
    "Pour in enough water to cover the ingredients and bring to a simmer.",
    "Cover the tagine and transfer to the oven.",
    "Bake at 300°F (150°C) for 30 minutes.",
    "Remove from oven and let rest for 10 minutes before serving."
